# The entrance's copy, at the lead's ask (25 Nov 2026): the lede, the name field, two interests and the privacy list.

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: what is inside, and what is asked"
msgid "Just inside are the village's roles, its \"game\" and the work of building it together. We share a lot about who we are and how we co-create, so we'd like to know a bit about you too!"
msgstr "Aquí dentro están los roles de la aldea, su \"juego\" y el trabajo de construirla juntos. Compartimos mucho sobre quiénes somos y cómo co-creamos, así que nos gustaría saber un poco sobre ti también."

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: what draws you, a founding seeder"
msgid "Becoming a \"Founding Seeder\""
msgstr "Ser \"Semilla Fundadora\""

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: what draws you, a role"
msgid "A role on our team"
msgstr "Un rol en nuestro equipo"

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: name field"
msgid "Name or Nickname"
msgstr "Nombre o apodo"

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: the privacy list, its greeting"
msgid "Hi friend:"
msgstr "Hola, amiga o amigo:"

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: the privacy list, what you type"
msgid "We keep what you type here, so it's saved for you."
msgstr "Guardamos lo que escribes aquí, para que no lo pierdas."

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: the privacy list, the pages opened, with the village's name"
msgid "We note which pages you open while you explore, so we know who is visiting {village} and can follow up with you."
msgstr "Anotamos qué páginas abres mientras exploras, para saber quién visita {village} y poder darte seguimiento."

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: the privacy list, the code by email, shown only while the village sends codes"
msgid "We email you a code to confirm your address, which you need to do if you want to go further in the process and stay in touch."
msgstr "Te enviamos un código por correo para confirmar tu dirección, algo necesario si quieres avanzar en el proceso y seguir en contacto."

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: the privacy list, the email list"
msgid "If you say yes to updates on the next step, we also add you to our email list, kept with an email service."
msgstr "Si en el siguiente paso dices que sí a recibir novedades, también te añadimos a nuestra lista de correo, que se guarda en un servicio de correo."

# needs-native-review: entrance copy, 2026-11-25
msgctxt "portal entrance: the privacy list, never sold"
msgid "We never sell any of it."
msgstr "Nunca vendemos nada de esto."
